Dan even to Beersheba.”

191
00:14:15,963 --> 00:14:20,483
He could not answer Abner another word,
because he was afraid of him.

192
00:14:21,443 --> 00:14:27,383
Abner sent messengers to David on his
behalf, saying, “Whose is the land?”

193
00:14:27,423 --> 00:14:33,903
and saying, “Make your alliance with me,
and behold, my hand will be with you to

194
00:14:33,943 --> 00:14:36,043
bring all Israel around to you.”

195
00:14:37,043 --> 00:14:38,543
David said, “Good.

196
00:14:39,163 --> 00:14:43,483
I will make a treaty with you, but one
thing I require of you.

197
00:14:43,903 --> 00:14:50,883
That is, you will not see my face
unless you first bring Michal, Saul’s daughter, when

198
00:14:50,923 --> 00:14:52,343
you come to see my face.”

199
00:14:52,773 --> 00:14:59,473
David sent messengers to Ishbosheth,
Saul’s son, saying, “Deliver me my wife

200
00:14:59,513 --> 00:15:04,833
Michal, whom I was given to marry for one
hundred foreskins of the Philistines.”

201
00:15:04,873 --> 00:15:11,673
Ishbosheth sent and took her from her
husband, Paltiel the son of Laish.

202
00:15:11,713 --> 00:15:16,893
Her husband went with her, weeping as he
went, and followed her to Bahurim.

203
00:15:18,013 --> 00:15:20,213
Then Abner said to him, “Go!

204
00:15:20,813 --> 00:15:21,713
Return!”

205
00:15:22,013 --> 00:15:22,913
and he returned.

206
00:15:23,853 --> 00:15:30,033
Abner had communication with the elders of
Israel, saying, “In times past, you sought

207
00:15:30,073 --> 00:15:32,013
for David to be king over you.

208
00:15:32,753 --> 00:15:33,933
Now then do it!

209
00:15:34,473 --> 00:15:40,453
For the LORD has spoken of David, saying, ‘By
the hand of my servant David, I will save

210
00:15:40,493 --> 00:15:45,993
my people Israel out of the hand of the
Philistines, and out of the hand of all their

211
00:15:46,033 --> 00:15:52,513
enemies.’” Abner also spoke in the ears of
Benjamin; and Abner went also to speak

212
00:15:52,553 --> 00:15:58,313
in the ears of David in Hebron all that
seemed good to Israel and to the whole house

213
00:15:58,353 --> 00:15:59,253
