438
00:34:29,469 --> 00:34:31,609
Therefore you are great, LORD God.

439
00:34:32,529 --> 00:34:38,529
For there is no one like you, neither
is there any God besides you, according to all

440
00:34:38,569 --> 00:34:40,089
that we have heard with our ears.

441
00:34:40,949 --> 00:34:46,769
What one nation in the earth is like your
people, even like Israel, whom God went to

442
00:34:46,809 --> 00:34:52,889
