445
00:35:02,829 --> 00:35:09,169
You established for yourself your people Israel
to be your people forever; and you, LORD,

446
00:35:09,209 --> 00:35:10,649
became their God.

447
00:35:11,569 --> 00:35:18,009
“Now, LORD God, the word that you
have spoken concerning your servant, and concerning

448
00:35:18,049 --> 00:35:22,689
his house, confirm it forever, and do as
you have spoken.

449
00:35:23,589 --> 00:35:30,669
