LORD of Armies is God over Israel; and

450
00:35:30,709 --> 00:35:34,249
the house of your servant David will be
established before you.’

451
00:35:35,029 --> 00:35:41,689
For you, LORD of Armies, the God of
Israel, have revealed to your servant, saying, ‘I

452
00:35:41,729 --> 00:35:42,849
