heart to pray this prayer to you.

454
00:35:48,598 --> 00:35:55,118
“Now, O Lord GOD, you are God, and your
words are truth, and you have

455
00:35:55,158 --> 00:35:57,518
promised this good thing to your servant.

456
00:35:58,578 --> 00:36:04,358
Now therefore, let it please you to bless
the house of your servant, that it may continue

457
00:36:04,398 --> 00:36:08,798
