have spoken it.

458
00:36:08,838 --> 00:36:13,538
Let the house of your servant be blessed
forever with your blessing.”

459
00:36:13,578 --> 00:36:17,978
Second Samuel, chapter eight.

460
00:36:18,018 --> 00:36:24,478
After this, David struck the Philistines and
subdued them; and David took the bridle

461
00:36:24,518 --> 00:36:27,518
of the mother city out of the hand of the
Philistines.

462
