467
00:36:53,338 --> 00:36:58,858
David took from him one thousand and
seven hundred horsemen and twenty thousand footmen.

468
00:36:59,258 --> 00:37:05,018
David hamstrung the chariot horses, but reserved
enough of them for one hundred chariots.

469
00:37:05,558 --> 00:37:11,418
When the Syrians of Damascus came to
help Hadadezer king of Zobah, David struck twenty

470
00:37:11,458 --> 00:37:13,398
two thousand men of the Syrians.

471
00:37:14,238 --> 00:37:20,218
Then David put garrisons in Syria of
Damascus; and the Syrians became servants to David,

472
00:37:20,258 --> 00:37:21,538
and brought tribute.

473
00:37:22,498 --> 00:37:25,438
The LORD gave victory to David wherever he
went.

474
00:37:25,478 --> 00:37:31,818
David took the shields of gold that were
on the servants of Hadadezer, and brought them

475
00:37:31,858 --> 00:37:32,758
