478
00:37:41,698 --> 00:37:48,198
When Toi king of Hamath heard that David
had struck all the army of Hadadezer, then Toi

479
00:37:48,238 --> 00:37:54,458
sent Joram his son to King David to greet
him and to bless him, because he had fought

480
00:37:54,498 --> 00:37:59,618
against Hadadezer and struck him; for
Hadadezer had wars with Toi.

481
00:37:59,658 --> 00:38:05,638
Joram brought with him vessels of silver,
vessels of gold, and vessels of bronze.

482
00:38:06,226 --> 00:38:12,066
King David also dedicated these to the LORD,
with the silver and gold that he dedicated

483
00:38:12,106 --> 00:38:18,906
of all the nations which he subdued— of
Syria, of Moab, of the children of

484
00:38:18,946 --> 00:38:25,446
Ammon, of the Philistines, of Amalek, and
of the plunder of Hadadezer, son of

485
00:38:25,486 --> 00:38:27,106
Rehob, king of Zobah.

486
00:38:27,666 --> 00:38:33,686
David earned a reputation when he returned
from striking down eighteen thousand men of

487
00:38:33,726 --> 00:38:35,546
the Syrians in the Valley of Salt.

488
00:38:36,546 --> 00:38:38,166
He put garrisons in Edom.

489
00:38:38,946 --> 00:38:44,866
Throughout all Edom, he put garrisons, and
all the Edomites became servants to David.

490
00:38:45,386 --> 00:38:48,306
The LORD gave victory to David wherever he
went.

491
00:38:48,946 --> 00:39:00,166
David reigned over all Israel; and David

492
00:39:00,206 --> 00:39:00,506
executed justice and righteousness for all
his people.

493
00:39:00,546 --> 00:39:03,346
Joab the son of Zeruiah was over the
army, Jehoshaphat the son of Ahilud was recorder,

494
00:39:03,386 --> 00:39:11,186
Zadok the son of Ahitub and Ahimelech the
son of Abiathar were priests, Seraiah

495
