continually.”

518
00:40:47,788 --> 00:40:54,228
He bowed down, and said, “What is your servant,
that you should look at such a dead dog

519
00:40:54,268 --> 00:40:55,168
as I am?”

520
00:40:55,708 --> 00:41:02,208
Then the king called to Ziba, Saul’s servant,
and said to him, “All that belonged to

521
00:41:02,248 --> 00:41:06,288
Saul and to all his house I have given to
your master’s son.

522
00:41:06,928 --> 00:41:10,888
Till the land for him—you, your sons, and
