527
00:41:32,228 --> 00:41:33,808
so your servant will do.”

528
00:41:35,088 --> 00:41:39,228
So Mephibosheth ate at the king’s table
like one of the king’s sons.

529
00:41:40,808 --> 00:41:44,508
Mephibosheth had a young son, whose name
was Mica.

530
00:41:44,548 --> 00:41:48,528
All who lived in Ziba’s house were
servants to Mephibosheth.

531
00:41:49,168 --> 00:41:55,068
So Mephibosheth lived in Jerusalem, for he
ate continually at the king’s table.

532
00:41:56,228 --> 00:41:57,928
