533
00:41:57,968 --> 00:42:01,408
Second Samuel, chapter ten.

534
00:42:01,448 --> 00:42:07,568
After this, the king of the children of
Ammon died, and Hanun his son reigned in his

535
00:42:07,608 --> 00:42:08,508
