the son of Nahash, as his father showed kindness

537
00:42:15,508 --> 00:42:16,408
to me.”

538
00:42:17,228 --> 00:42:21,128
So David sent by his servants to comfort
him concerning his father.

539
00:42:22,388 --> 00:42:25,868
David’s servants came into the land of the
children of Ammon.

540
00:42:26,368 --> 00:42:31,968
But the princes of the children of Ammon
said to Hanun their lord, “Do you think that

541
00:42:32,008 --> 00:42:42,968
David honours your father, in that he has
sent comforters to

542
00:42:43,008 --> 00:42:43,308
you?

543
00:42:43,348 --> 00:42:43,648
Hasn’t David sent his servants to you to search
the city, to spy it out, and to overthrow

544
00:42:43,688 --> 00:42:43,988
it?”

545
00:42:44,028 --> 00:42:49,688
So Hanun took David’s servants, shaved off
one half of their beards, and cut off

546
00:42:49,728 --> 00:42:54,468
their garments in the middle, even to
their buttocks, and sent them away.

547
00:42:54,863 --> 00:43:00,423
When they told David this, he sent to meet
them, for the men were greatly ashamed.

548
00:43:01,503 --> 00:43:07,303
The king said, “Wait at Jericho until your
beards have grown, and then return.”

549
00:43:08,103 --> 00:43:13,363
When the children of Ammon saw that they
had become odious to David, the children of

550
00:43:13,403 --> 00:43:20,203
Ammon sent and hired the Syrians of Beth
Rehob and the Syrians of Zobah, twenty thousand

551
00:43:20,243 --> 00:43:26,943
footmen, and the king of Maacah with one
thousand men, and the men of Tob twelve thousand

552
00:43:26,983 --> 00:43:27,763
men.

553
00:43:27,803 --> 00:43:32,803
When David heard of it, he sent Joab and
all the army of the mighty men.

554
00:43:33,603 --> 00:43:39,083
The children of Ammon came out, and put the
battle in array at the entrance of the gate.

555
00:43:40,183 --> 00:43:46,843
The Syrians of Zobah and of Rehob and the
men of Tob and Maacah were by themselves in

556
00:43:46,883 --> 00:43:47,783
the field.

557
00:43:47,883 --> 00:43:54,303
Now when Joab saw that the battle was set
against him before and behind, he chose of

558
00:43:54,343 --> 00:43:58,863
all the choice men of Israel and put them
in array against the Syrians.

559
00:44:00,103 --> 00:44:05,323
The rest of the people he committed into
the hand of Abishai his brother; and he put

560
00:44:05,363 --> 00:44:07,863
them in array against the children of
Ammon.

561
00:44:08,443 --> 00:44:15,043
He said, “If the Syrians are too strong for
me, then you shall help me; but if the children

562
00:44:15,083 --> 00:44:19,343
of Ammon are too strong for you, then I
will come and help you.

563
00:44:19,983 --> 00:44:26,623
Be courageous, and let’s be strong for our
people and for the cities of our God; and

564
00:44:26,663 --> 00:44:28,863
may the LORD do what seems good to him.”

565
00:44:29,403 --> 00:44:34,163
So Joab and the people who were with
him came near to the battle against the Syrians,

566
00:44:35,103 --> 00:44:36,323
and they fled before him.

567
00:44:37,103 --> 00:44:43,803
When the children of Ammon saw that the
Syrians had fled, they likewise fled before Abishai,

568
00:44:43,843 --> 00:44:45,643
and entered into the city.

569
00:44:46,163 --> 00:44:50,263
Then Joab returned from the children of
Ammon and came to Jerusalem.

570
00:44:51,703 --> 00:44:56,943
When the Syrians saw that they were
defeated by Israel, they gathered themselves together.

571
00:44:56,983 --> 00:45:03,423
Hadadezer sent and brought out the Syrians who
