575
00:45:17,647 --> 00:45:22,127
The Syrians set themselves in array
against David and fought with him.

576
00:45:22,907 --> 00:45:29,127
The Syrians fled before Israel; and David
killed seven hundred charioteers of the Syrians

577
00:45:29,167 --> 00:45:38,447
and forty thousand horsemen, and

578
00:45:38,487 --> 00:45:38,787
struck Shobach the captain of their army,
so that he died there.

579
00:45:38,827 --> 00:45:42,767
When all the kings who were servants
to Hadadezer saw that they were defeated before

580
00:45:42,807 --> 00:45:46,807
Israel, they made peace with Israel and
served them.

581
00:45:47,307 --> 00:45:52,062
So the Syrians were afraid to help the
children of Ammon any more.

582
00:45:52,102 --> 00:45:55,507
Second Samuel, chapter eleven.

583
00:45:55,547 --> 00:46:02,087
At the return of the year, at the time
when kings go out, David sent Joab and

584
00:46:02,127 --> 00:46:08,387
his servants with him, and all Israel; and
they destroyed the children of Ammon and besieged

585
00:46:08,427 --> 00:46:09,607
