2518
03:21:08,645 --> 03:21:11,305
all the prophets were prophesying before
them.

2519
03:21:11,805 --> 03:21:18,525
Zedekiah the son of Chenaanah made himself
horns of iron, and said, “The LORD says,

2520
03:21:19,385 --> 03:21:26,165
