2608
03:28:02,004 --> 03:28:07,784
Jehoshaphat slept with his fathers, and was
buried with his fathers in his father David’s

2609
03:28:07,824 --> 03:28:08,124
city.

2610
03:28:08,164 --> 03:28:11,724
