way of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, in which he

2615
03:28:36,884 --> 03:28:38,324
made Israel to sin.

2616
03:28:39,064 --> 03:28:45,464
He served Baal and worshipped him, and provoked
the Lord, the God of Israel, to anger

2617
03:28:45,504 --> 03:28:48,364
